    "contentHtml": "<h1>Organs and Lipoma Diet</h1>\n<p>Organ feeding rules, TCVM protein temperatures, and the anti-inflammatory diet for [[Hershey]]&#39;s lipomas. Part of [[Nutrition]]; the applied plan is in [[Hershey Health Protocol]].</p>\n<h2>Organ 10% rule</h2>\n<p><strong>Only LIVER has the 10% cap</strong> (Vitamin A accumulates — fat-soluble). It&#39;s the best source of A, B12, folate, iron, copper.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Kidney</strong> — caution only in very high amounts (B12, selenium, iron, zinc).</li>\n<li><strong>Spleen</strong> — rich; loose stools if overdone.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Muscle meats classified as &quot;organs&quot; but with NO accumulation risk — feed freely:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Heart</strong> — one of the best ingredients: TAURINE, CoQ10, B vitamins, iron, zinc. Can be a primary protein.</li>\n<li><strong>Gizzard, lung, tripe</strong> — fine in higher quantities (tripe also brings probiotics + enzymes).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>TCVM protein temperatures (Hershey runs hot → lean cooling)</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Temp</th>\n<th>Proteins</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Cooling (best for Hershey)</strong></td>\n<td>Duck, fish/salmon, rabbit, venison</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Neutral (fine)</td>\n<td>Beef, turkey, pork</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Warming (limit as staple)</td>\n<td>Chicken, lamb</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Goal is an <strong>overall cooling trend</strong>, not a perfect every-meal rule. Be strict about avoiding warming proteins only if he shows active heat signs (excess panting, red eyes, always thirsty, seeking cold surfaces). Fish/salmon is the highest-priority protein to add next — cooling + best omega-3s.</p>\n<h2>Lipoma management diet</h2>\n<p><strong>Avoid:</strong> sunflower/safflower/corn/soybean/vegetable oil (high omega-6, inflammatory); corn/wheat/soy; peas/lentils/chickpeas/canola; BHA/BHT/ethoxyquin/artificial colors/sugar; high-carb foods. Most gently cooked brands fail here (pea protein, canola, synthetic vitamins).</p>\n<p><strong>Support:</strong> Simple Food Project (~0.85:1 omega ratio, anti-inflammatory anchor) · fish/salmon · duck · Four Leaf Rover Liver &amp; Kidney Clean (lipoma + Heartgard detox). AllProvide and Primal avoid the inflammatory ingredients — why they work.</p>\n<h2>Active affiliate products (Amazon Associates)</h2>\n<p>Native Pet Omega (fish oil) · Native Pet Probiotic · Simple Food Project · Four Leaf Rover Liver &amp; Kidney · Adored Beast Digestive Enzymes (non-affiliate — apply to program). These feed [[PawGrade]]&#39;s <code>SUPPLEMENT_RECS</code> cards.</p>\n"
